{# BJJ Concept Template V3 - Jinja2 #}
{# Generates markdown from TEMPLATE.json for abstract principles/concepts #}
{# A/B Testing: variant-a-show/variant-b-hide CSS classes #}

---
title: "{{metadata.title}}"
description: "{{metadata.description}}"
---


<!-- Schema Markup - Auto-generated from JSON -->
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "HowTo",
  "name": "How to Apply {{metadata.title.split('|')[0].strip()}} in BJJ",
  "description": "Decision framework for applying {{metadata.title.split('|')[0].strip()}}.",
  "step": [
    {%- for step in decision_framework[:6] %}
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "name": "{{step.decision_point}}",
      "text": "{{step.action}}",
      "position": {{loop.index}}
    }{{ "," if not loop.last else "" }}
    {%- endfor %}
  ]
}
</script>

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "WebPage",
  "name": "{{metadata.title.split('|')[0].strip()}}",
  "description": "{{metadata.description}}",
  "url": "https://bjjgraph.org/Principles/{{metadata.title.split('|')[0].strip().replace(' ', '-')}}",
  "isPartOf": {
    "@type": "WebSite",
    "name": "BJJ Graph",
    "url": "https://bjjgraph.org"
  }
}
</script>

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
  "itemListElement": [
    {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://bjjgraph.org/"},
    {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Principles", "item": "https://bjjgraph.org/Principles/"},
    {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "{{metadata.title.split('|')[0].strip()}}", "item": "https://bjjgraph.org/Principles/{{metadata.title.split('|')[0].strip().replace(' ', '-')}}"}
  ]
}
</script>

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {%- for error in common_errors[:6] %}
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What is a common mistake in {{error.error}}?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "{{error.consequence}} The correction is: {{error.correction}}"
      }
    }{{ "," if not loop.last else "" }}
    {%- endfor %}
  ]
}
</script>


# {{metadata.title.split('|')[0].strip()}}
{% for tag in metadata.tags %}#{{tag}} {% endfor %}

> **Quick Answer**: {{metadata.title.split('|')[0].strip()}} is a {{metadata.complexity_level|lower}} complexity BJJ concept applicable at the {{metadata.application_level}} level. Master this principle in {{metadata.development_timeline}}.

**Concept ID**: {{metadata.concept_id}}
**Application Level**: {{metadata.application_level}}
**Complexity**: {{metadata.complexity_level}}
**Development Timeline**: {{metadata.development_timeline}}

<section id="overview" class="content-section">

## What is {{metadata.title.split('|')[0].strip()}}?

{{overview}}

</section>

<section id="key-principles" class="content-section">

## What Are the Fundamental Principles?
{% for principle in key_principles -%}
- {{principle}}
{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="component-skills" class="content-section">

## What Skills Make Up This Concept?
{% for skill in component_skills -%}
**{{skill.skill_name}}**: {{skill.description}}

{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="concept-relationships" class="content-section">

## How Does This Concept Relate to Others?
{% for rel in concept_relationships -%}
- **[[{{rel.concept_name}}]]** ({{rel.relationship_type}}): {{rel.description}}
{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="application-contexts" class="content-section">

## Where Do You Apply This Concept?
{% for context in application_contexts -%}
**{{context.context}}**: {{context.how_applied}}

{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="decision-framework" class="content-section">

## How to Make Decisions Using This Concept
{% for step in decision_framework -%}
{{step.step_number}}. **{{step.decision_point}}**: {{step.action}}
{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="common-errors" class="content-section hide-minimal">

## What Mistakes Do Practitioners Make With This Concept?
{% for error in common_errors -%}
- **Error**: {{error.error}}
  - **Consequence**: {{error.consequence}}
  - **Correction**: {{error.correction}}
{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="training-approaches" class="content-section hide-minimal">

## How to Train This Concept
{% for approach in training_approaches -%}
**{{approach.approach_name}}** (Focus: {{approach.focus}})
{{approach.description}}

{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="developmental-metrics" class="content-section">

## How to Measure Mastery of This Concept
{% for metric in developmental_metrics -%}
**{{metric.level}} Level**:
{% for behavior in metric.observable_behaviors -%}
- {{behavior}}
{% endfor %}

{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="related-content" class="content-section">

## Which Content Is Related to This Concept?

{% for item in related_content -%}
- [[{{item.name}}]] ({{item.content_type}}) - {{item.relationship}}
{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="expert-insights" class="content-section expert-insight">

## What Do the Experts Say About This Concept?
- **John Danaher**: {{expert_insights.danaher}}
- **Gordon Ryan**: {{expert_insights.gordon_ryan}}
- **Eddie Bravo**: {{expert_insights.eddie_bravo}}

</section>
